OL,3,GNEWSACar park and college demolition to
OL,4,Astart in autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to demolish a multi-storey car
OL,7,Fpark and former college site in
OL,8,FNottingham is due to begin later this
OL,9,Fyear, it has been announced.
OL,11,FThe NCP car park and former Bluecoat
OL,12,Fsixth form college on Maid Marian Way
OL,13,Fform part of the wider redevelopment of
OL,14,Fthe Broad Marsh area of the city.
OL,16,FHomes England, the government's housing
OL,17,Fand regeneration agency, bought the
OL,18,Fsite last year with plans to turn it
OL,19,Finto about 1,000 homes, alongside up to
OL,20,F20,000 sq m (215,000 sq ft) of retail,
OL,21,Foffice and community space.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
