OL,3,GNEWSACar park and college demolition to
OL,4,Astart in autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FJo Nugent, executive director for the
OL,7,FMidlands at Homes England, said
OL,8,Fdemolition contractors will be
OL,9,Fappointed to tear down the car park in
OL,10,Fthe coming months.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
